{"l":6522,"g":7,"b":3,"cefr":"B1","role":"challenge","insight":"reframing","k":"l","q":"Læs: 'Leo apologised for being late, explaining that his bike had a flat tyre.' Hvorfor kom Leo for sent?","o":["Han havde sovet over sig.","Han var punkteret.","Han havde glemt tiden.","Han var syg."],"a":"Han var punkteret.","r":"'A flat tyre' er et fladt dæk: Leo var punkteret."},
