{"l":6547,"g":7,"b":3,"cefr":"B1","role":"challenge","insight":"reframing","k":"l","q":"Læs: 'The museum is free for students, but you must show your student card.' Hvad skal en studerende gøre for at komme gratis ind?","o":["betale halv pris","komme om morgenen","købe et kort","vise sit studiekort"],"a":"vise sit studiekort","r":"'You must show your student card' = du skal vise dit studiekort."},
{"l":6560,"g":7,"b":3,"cefr":"B1","role":"challenge","insight":"reframing","k":"l","q":"Læs: 'He was the only one who didn't laugh at the joke.' Hvad passer?","o":["Alle andre grinede.","Ingen grinede.","Han grinede mest.","Kun han grinede."],"a":"Alle andre grinede.","r":"'The only one who didn't laugh' = den eneste, der ikke grinede."},
{"l":6573,"g":7,"b":4,"cefr":"B1","role":"challenge","insight":"reframing","k":"l","q":"Læs: 'Despite being very tired, she finished the race.' Hvad passer?","o":["Hun stoppede, fordi hun var træt.","Hun gennemførte løbet, selvom hun var træt.","Hun var ikke træt.","Hun vandt løbet."],"a":"Hun gennemførte løbet, selvom hun var træt.","r":"'Despite' betyder på trods af."},
