{"l":6686,"g":7,"b":4,"cefr":"B1","role":"challenge","insight":"reframing","k":"l","q":"Læs: 'You can either take the train or the bus. Both take about an hour.' Hvad passer?","o":["Toget er meget hurtigere.","Bussen er meget hurtigere.","Begge muligheder tager omtrent lige lang tid.","Man skal tage både tog og bus."],"a":"Begge muligheder tager omtrent lige lang tid.","r":"'Both take about an hour' = begge tager cirka en time."},
