{"l":7001,"g":7,"b":5,"cefr":"B2","role":"challenge","insight":"reframing","k":"g","q":"Hvilket ord passer: 'If I ___ more time, I would learn to play the piano.'","o":["had","have","would have","will have"],"a":"had","r":"Anden konditional: if + datid, would + udsagnsord. Det handler om noget tænkt."},
{"l":7011,"g":7,"b":5,"cefr":"B2","role":"challenge","insight":"reframing","k":"g","q":"Hvilket ord passer: 'If we had left earlier, we ___ the train.'","o":["would catch","would have caught","will catch","had caught"],"a":"would have caught","r":"Tredje konditional: if + had + kort tillægsform, would have + kort tillægsform."},
